"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage05.png", "id": "2214028069052374", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_2214028072385707_966198005100103568_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hl5NiIfgylcQ7kNvwGLK1jR&_nc_oc=Adp8wMjA5mA8yMvVZZi1Low4DKRySV7s8_D4kowxrZ7cIeQLwv-PMf9qd41sAhGWgqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRrG-GSOj55wqLxfqaJ1gyY5ZmAqDOmGxK3MFppI7TLfQ&oe=6B09C87C"}, {"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage03.png", "id": "1315333866150469", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982517_1315333869483802_8451455932263526366_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LU898wW7R68Q7kNvwF6jyIK&_nc_oc=AdppAmyppaNRCNNM_9qnmvE3v2wqNP5YGH67COuYj6MBswLkB_eyq2w7mQ3KoLjMrWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR42Rn1ilNKlfQ3IibJcjZEt3Q--TXcftbYL1awI-pImQ&oe=6B09A4DA"}, {"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage02.png", "id": "600762692399494", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974856_600762695732827_6505960866598570138_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lYvBA2eFfUsQ7kNvwGnZEgO&_nc_oc=AdoVFxdkIiBoH8IPZ6khBi6YQCPXZoiA17-qhQxXNjho8wIt_LkPHyfTiKddKKD6Zhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSztqNSCCw68lkNFs-Y5PiiD62PX87dQi53OrbkjrIb3w&oe=6B09ABD1"}, {"file_name": "EclipseDefenceImage01.png", "id": "2063620994075579", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210888_2063620997408912_6888476953228441268_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PCr-Inza3CIQ7kNvwHFgbeo&_nc_oc=AdoAN_BQbP1q8S19d2sPHgz_mWQCiFMbr77mZI6_Q9V9DrEHRDmD27laAAHCCVkjOVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSq1_jmqpFpPC1fxEn8VN-PrnQ6K2Yzu-uPA4K4Gtv1cQ&oe=6B09C5E6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Eclipse Defense", "keywords": ["space", "defense", "spaceship", "gravity"], "long_description": "A Hero\u2019s Call in Space \u2013 The Ultimate VR Experience at Eclipse Defense\n\nIn this thrilling VR game, you are a skilled space worker tasked with saving the world from destruction. As your spaceship docks with a massive space station, chaos unfolds. Meteors are hurtling toward Earth, and only you can stop them!\n\nKey Features:\n Immersive Space Exploration: Experience realistic docking mechanics as you pilot and connect your spaceship to the station.\n Interactive Environment: Explore the detailed interiors of the space station, complete with tools, ladders, and control systems.\n Intense Meteor Defense: Climb to the upper levels, activate the shooter cannon, and unleash firepower to destroy waves of meteors.\n Dynamic Challenges: Repair systems, manage alerts, and face emergencies while defending the station.\n Stunning Visuals: A breathtaking sci-fi environment with dynamic lighting, realistic damage effects, and vast space backdrops.\n\nThe world depends on you! Grab your tools, man the cannons, and fight to protect Earth in this heart-pounding VR space adventure.", "short_description": "Dock, Defend, and Save the World!\nStep into the boots of a space worker in this immersive VR experience. Dock your spaceship at the station, take control of powerful shooter cannons, and defend Earth from an onslaught of meteors threatening humanity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chef.gs/eclipse-defense-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.chef.gs/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "CHEF Game Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.chef.gs/contact", "website_url": "https://www.chef.gs/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "externa